    "div" : "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narrativa gerada: ValueSet BRCoreMedicationNotGiven</b></p><a name=\"BRCoreMedicationNotGiven\"> </a><a name=\"hcBRCoreMedicationNotGiven\"> </a><ul><li>Include estes códigos, tal como definidos em <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-reason-medication-not-given-codes.html\"><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/reason-medication-not-given</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to 4.0.1, the version found through the package references\"> versão &#x1F4E6;4.0.1</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Código</b></td><td><b>Ecrã</b></td><td><b>Definição</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-reason-medication-not-given-codes.html#reason-medication-not-given-codes-d\">d</a></td><td>Vomit</td><td>The patient was given the medication and immediately vomited it back.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-reason-medication-not-given-codes.html#reason-medication-not-given-codes-c\">c</a></td><td>Asleep</td><td>The patient was asleep when the dose was scheduled.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-reason-medication-not-given-codes.html#reason-medication-not-given-codes-b\">b</a></td><td>Away</td><td>The patient was not available when the dose was scheduled.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-reason-medication-not-given-codes.html#reason-medication-not-given-codes-a\">a</a></td><td>None</td><td>No reason known.</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
